window.products.push({"id":1025007,"name":"Fleece Throw Blanket Sherpa Throw Blankets Super Soft Fluffy Warm Plush Blanket for Couch/ Bed, Lightweight Microfiber Throws for Winter 50 x 60 White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nL0NYBz7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【KEEP SOFT & COZY 】- WGCC throw blanket is made of high grade 350GSM of 100% premium microfiber polyester that feels as caressing a piece of cloud floating in the sky. Absolutely supreme comfortable and lightwight experiencend for keeping warm and safety, when watching TV series with a cup of hot coffee, especially on chilly nights. As your perfect companion, this blanket can also be used when taking a break from work, reading and traveling. 【LIGHTWEIGHT AND BREATHABLE】- Stay warm and cozy all year long which is best for camping, backpacking or for use in an air condition room. Enough weight to keep you comfortable, yet light enough to keep you from breaking out in sweat. And the improved antistatic finish will effectively improve the situation of statics. In addition, this blanket can also be used as a pet quilt, intimate and warm. 【DECORATIVE】- The throw blanket features a velvet touch softness and rich and inviting designs, featuring a double-faced plush with graceful luster. And the textured jacquard pattern offers a unique silhouette and modern look, easily coordinates or enhances existing bedding or home décor. Uplifts the look of your Bedrooms, Living Rooms, Bedding, Sofa, Couch, Car and Offices. 【PREMIUM QUALITY & DURABILITY】- Soft fleece blanket lasts for long use and provides fade resistance better than others like cotton blankets. Microfiber blanket is NOT tend to bunch with time like cotton which has little elasticity to keep its shape. 【EASY CARE】- Machine wash with cold water on gentle and delicate. Tumble dry on low heat. Avoid direct heat and no bleach. Wash alone to prevent abrasion. No shrinkage, No color fading, and No unravelling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nL0NYBz7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WGCC","source_asin":"B08JQD4XLZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1025007","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JQD4XLZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JQD4XLZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
