window.products.push({"id":1025012,"name":"Rustic State Smith Wall Mount Floating Shelf with Rail & 10 Hooks - Spice Rack - Coat Hanger - Farmhouse Décor Storage Organizer for Kitchen Bathroom ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ijockL-QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tidy Up Your Kitchen with an Authentic Decoration that will Provide You Extra Room to Work More Productively… Multi-Purpose Storage Solution: Made of reclaimed wood this beautifully crafted floating shelf can be used in your bedroom, nursery, home office, kitchen, entryway, or living room. Any space you need an extra space storage solution and rustic home décor, this shelf will come in handy. This hanging organizer can be used inside your closets as well, use it to store your cleaning supplies, so everything is easy to find. But that’s not all, this rustic wall décor will make the perfect jewelry organizer, use the shelf to store your skin care, hair care, perfumes, etc. and the hooks to hang your necklaces, bracelets, or other jewelry. Your accessories will no longer get tangled or lost, giving you frustration each time you want to put something on to match your outfit and walk out the door. Perfect Bathroom Organizer: Add style and flair to your dull bathroom space for only a fraction of the cost of other suppliers. The shelf is great for using in your bathroom to organize your toiletry, bathroom accessories and to keep your toothbrush holder handy. This rustic bathroom décor is great for hanging your towels near your shower, so you won’t catch a cold every time you forget to grab one before hopping in the shower. This shelf comes with 5 sturdy hooks to also help you efficiently store your blow dryer, hair straightener, iron curler, etc. Don’t miss the opportunity to spunk up your walls in the comfort of your home and have it delivered to your door step. Specifications: Material: Reclaimed Wood Color: Walnut Product Measurements: L 17” x W 3 ½” x H 2” Please Note: Due to monitor variations colors may appear slightly different. Package Content : 1 17” Rustic Kitchen Décor Spice Rack and Mounting Hardware","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ijockL-QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rustic State","source_asin":"B07526J8B6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1025012","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07526J8B6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07526J8B6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
