window.products.push({"id":1025121,"name":"Acliys Serving bowl With Metal Tray Glass Divided Serving Dish Appetizer Tray with 6 Removable Snack Bowls for Fruit Candy Nuts Snacks Chip Dip (Gold,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.87,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UF3CzqJVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Functional design and ease of use: All parts of the fruit bowl are separated to facilitate the replenishment of food for the party. You don't need to take an entire tray to replenish the food. Separate compartments also make washing dishes and storage easy. Stylish and versatile：6 glass snack bowls are separated and placed on a wire rack. These items are very sturdy and elegant in appearance. Versatile: Elegant tableware for potato chips, dips, snacks, bacon, cheese, candy, olives, nuts, fruits, vegetables, condiments and a variety of appetizers.A very good service tray. Wide range of application: Suitable for parties such as birthday parties, baby showers, Christmas, tea parties, celebrations or any other event decoration tableware. Also great for dining, outdoor picnics, barbecues and simply eating at home. Suitable size: glass cup 9*9*5.5cm/3.54*3.54*2.16*in. Iron frame 28*19cm/11.02*7.48in","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UF3CzqJVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Acliys","source_asin":"B0BP6DWBZL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1025121","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP6DWBZL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP6DWBZL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1025122,"name":"Technivorm Moccamaster KBG White Metallic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91fYHGu6jhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Moccamaster KBG coffeemaker features a glass carafe and an automatic drip-stop brew-basket that stops the flow of coffee if the carafe is pulled away. The KBG brews a full 40oz pot of Coffee in six minutes. Coffee is then held on our unique hot-plate; which is engineered with a separate, independent element that rolls heat into the coffee to ensure an even taste from the first cup to the last drop. The hot-plate has two settings, giving you the choice to hold your coffee between 175° and 185° F, while never burning your Coffee. After 100 minutes, The hot-plate will automatically turn-off. All Moccamaster coffeemakers are handmade in the Netherlands and backed by an industry leading 5-year.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91fYHGu6jhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Technivorm Moccamaster","source_asin":"B00QKKYF28","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1025122","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00QKKYF28","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00QKKYF28","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1025123,"name":"coorack Under Sink Organizers and Storage, 2 Tier Sliding Cabinet Basket Organizer Drawer with Hooks, Under Cabinet Storage for Bathroom Kitchen Multi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VhytIkcNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Slide Out Under Sink Organizers and storage】The under sink organizer is designed to be pulled out which is more convenient to use than other normal storage organizers. The bottom slide-out drawer design will make picking and taking more flexible and easier in limited space. Comes with 4 side hooks for hanging some small items, effectively using the limited space. Modern and simple nordic style design can be matched well with most household styles. 【Save Space & Neatly Organized】Very compact 2-tier sliding under sink organizer maximizes vertical space and makes full use of the cabinet space, such as kitchen under sink for cleaning supplies, bathroom under sink for toiletries and so on. Ideal for bathroom, kitchen, living room, office and other places. It also can separate from 2 layers to a tray, perfect for holding glasses, plates, bowls, etc. Freed up a ton of room under the sink. 【Higher & Larger Dimensions】Don't worry about the spray bottle not going in. We updated the height of bottom shelf based on other brands of under sink organizer, our bottom drawer can hold bottles up to 10.6 inches high. Assembly dimensions is 15.8\"L x 10.2\"W x 14.2\"H, higher and wider, not only suitable for most under-sink cabinets but also accommodate more of the daily needs of the bathroom or kitchen supplies, making all bottles and jars more neat and orderly. 【Easy & Fast Assemble & High Quality】No Tools and Screw Required & No break the cabinet. Easily assemble the under cabinet storage in 1 minute. Even slim housewives or children can assemble it with our clear assembly manual. Made of quality ABS plastic and 4 sturdy stainless steel tubes, which is good rust prevention and strong bearing capacity. Free-standing, solid build that will not tip over or fall. Quick and easy snap together assembly, easy care. 【Easy to Clean & Quality Assured】Top tier of the under sink storage adopt to hollow design which has a good draining effect and prevents moldy. Simply wipe the surface with a damp cloth to clean the shelf. The pull out drawer can help you to better clean the dead corners and clean in all directions. Your satisfaction is what drives us to provide the highest quality products. If any problem with our kitchen cabinet organizer, please reach out to us at any time for after-sales services.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VhytIkcNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FVLFIL","source_asin":"B09YTHRC4B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1025123","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YTHRC4B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YTHRC4B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
