window.products.push({"id":1025139,"name":"X-cosrack 4 Blade Wood Stove Fan Heat Powered Fireplace Fan with Magnetic Thermometer for Wood Log Burner Slient Eco-Frienly Aluminium Black Large","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dtXmFM0qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With X-cosrack Heat Powered Stove Fan, Keeping Warm is So Easy. No need to sit closely to fire any more! If you own a fireplace or wood burning stove and would like to get MORE HEAT throughout house but DO NOT want to spend more money on electricity - all you have to do is get this amazing Heat Powered Fireplace Stove Fan. No Batteries or Electricity Needed: The heat-powered wood stove fan generates its power by converting the heat from stove into electricity, electricity generating units convert the heat energy into kinetic energy to drive the motor, then the blades spin. The fan starts to rotate when the stove temperature reaches 122°F.The hotter the base of the fan gets,the faster the fan turns, the more warm air the fan circulates into the room. It slow down and stop as the fireplace cools. Versatile Stove Fan: Work well all stove/fireplaces, such as gas, electric, pellet stove, log burner or wood burning stove, catalytic and non-catalytic Simple to Use: Just place the stove fan on a smooth flat surface of your stove top, near the side or back of the stovepipe. Need to place stove fan at least 4\" away from stovepipe. It'll work when the stove surface hot. Over-heating Protection: Bimetallic strip at the bottom of fan base can protect wood stove fan from damage due to high temperature (over 644°F). Note: * Never handle the base of the stove fan, do not set the stove fan down on an unprotected surface when hot.* To move or carry the fan, always use the extendable handle while wearing gloves.* Please keep fan away from small children when in use. Parameters: * Material: Anodized aluminum* Fan Height: 7.48inch* Air flow: 250-360CFM(Max)* Running speed: 1350RPM(Max) *Silent operation,noise less than 25db Package including: 1x X-cosrack Heat Powered Stove Fan 1x Magnetic Thermometer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dtXmFM0qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"X-cosrack","source_asin":"B07XD6W6P4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1025139","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XD6W6P4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XD6W6P4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
