window.products.push({"id":1025193,"name":"Villeroy & Boch Wildberries Bread and Butter Plates, Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41RYF5Q779L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Wildberries Collection is a re-launch of an authentic \"fifties\" shape by Karl Leutner, an artistic personality in Germany during that time. Its styling consists of slightly rounded, softly flowing and simplistic lines which reflect earlier times that are appropriate today. It's translucency shines through this dainty and light bone china pattern rendered with scatter motifs including blackberries, daisies, and ladybugs. It also coordinates with the simply white Anmut Collection. Amazon.com Refined wildberry illustrations on this set of six plates evoke gracious garden settings, a signature theme of Villeroy & Boch dinnerware. Tastefully frame a raisin-filled bread-and-butter pudding, raspberry cobbler, fruit salad, and any variety of breads on this versatile 6-1/4-inch plate. The borders feature charming sprays of greenery with plump berries and little colorful blossoms offering a distinctive pattern, suitable for formal or casual settings. Complementing the varied designs in the Wildberries collection, these lovely plates also coordinate with the classic white Anmut line. Crafted from vitrified porcelain, this durable, fine china is dishwasher- and microwave-safe. The plates are imported from Germany and Luxemburg by the historic Villeroy & Boch, which has created an array of exceptional ceramics for over 250 years. --Roberta Cruger","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41RYF5Q779L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Villeroy & Boch","source_asin":"B0001VS1YU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1025193","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0001VS1YU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0001VS1YU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
