window.products.push({"id":1025353,"name":"Funtime FT825CR Antique Carnival-Style 8-Ounce Tabletop Hot-Oil Popcorn Popper, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":219.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xEay1UknL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There's nothing in the world like the smell and taste of fresh, theater-style hot buttered popcorn. The FunTime Carnival-Style Popcorn Machine will be the hit of every party. It's a great way to entertain your friends and family, while making some of the best tasting popcorn imaginable. This beautiful antique style popcorn machine brings back the fun feel of yesteryear, back to a time when you could buy a bag of hot buttery popcorn for only 5 cents. The FT825CR is a independent table top / bar style unit. Safety tempered glass side panels and metal construction makes this a very durable and safe to use machine. Power to the unit is delivered via the 3 Position control switches which controls the Spot Light & Deck Warmer, Kettle Stirrer, and Kettle Heater. The Flip up lids allow popcorn to pop out of the kettle and for those kernels that come out unpopped they are easily managed with the pull-out kernel catcher located under the warming deck. The FT825CR includes: FT825CR Popcorn Popper, Measuring Cup, Popcorn Scoop, Seasoning Shaker, and Instruction Manual. One Year Limited Warranty Provided by MaxTool. The FunTime Carnival Style Popcorn Poppers are a great addition to any game room, fundraiser or even home theater. Not only are do they look good but they are safe and easy to use as well. Cleanup is a breeze thanks to the detachable kettle which requires just being rinsed and wiped with a warm soapy water mixture. The FunTime Popcorn Poppers are a great way to enjoy theater style popcorn in the comfort of your own home. Buy one today and have it in time for your next movie night or fundraiser!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xEay1UknL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Funtime","source_asin":"B002NLKYPA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1025353","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002NLKYPA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002NLKYPA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
