window.products.push({"id":1025356,"name":"HoofPrints Found Collie Dog & Lamb Ready to Hang Plaque By Walter Hunt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZEeBz9bmL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Found - collie and lamb print by Walter Hunt - READY TO HANG PLAQUE Print is bonded to heavy composite wood board that has a slot for hanging on the back actual image is 10.5\" x 17\" with small black border showing on the edges for an elegant, clean look, plaque is 3/4\" thick. Indoor use only. MADE IN USA Everyone remembers this inspiring picture from their childhood days. We do not know the artist's name on this - for sure. Some attribute the work to Albrecht Schenck, other art historians think it's likely by Walter Hunt - (entitled \"Shepherd's Call\"); Hunt was known for his beautiful paintings of Collies.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZEeBz9bmL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HoofPrints","source_asin":"B07HRZCNQ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1025356","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HRZCNQ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HRZCNQ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
