window.products.push({"id":1025363,"name":"Taofwter Set of 3 Clear Plastic Storage Bins Containers, Multifunctional Plastic Kitchen Storage Container Bins with Handles for Organization in Pantr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GI6-R8U7L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"FUNCTIONAL & VERSATILE – 3-piece set gives you the choice of size you need, large box: 10.6*7.3*4.2 inches, medium box: 9.5*6.3*7.7 inches, small: 8.3*5.5*3.4 inches. Our clear containers are the perfect size to fit easily into your wardrobe while creating the perfect storage solution for your toiletries, makeup, toiletries or bedroom accessories! IDEAL STORAGE CHOICE – These kitchen organization and storage bins are great for creating a clean and organized refrigerator or pantry. Perfect clear storage bins for cube furniture shelving in office, entryway, closet, cabinet, bedroom, laundry room, nursery, and kids toy room. You can use these plastic storage bins anywhere in your home. PORTABLE - Our storage containers are integrated with handles that take up no extra space, making them durable and easy to carry, with handles designed to transport goods from pantry to shelf to dining table. The opening of the storage box is slightly larger than the bottom, which can improve space utilization. The thickened storage compartment organizer is sturdy enough to handle falls and the shock of everyday life. LIGHTWEIGHT BUT STURDY – Made of premium BPA free durable shatter-resistant plastic material, these refrigerator organizers are lightweight and sturdy. They are clear, so you can see what you want without having to take the whole bin out of the fridge.Ideal sized to fit fruits, vegetables yogurts, canned goods, food packets, cheese, meat, also good for storing dry goods in the pantry NOTE - When our freezer organizer needs to be cleaned, please use warm soapy water. Do not use a dishwasher. Be sure to rinse and keep food clean. If you are not satisfied with the product or have any questions, you can contact us and we will give a satisfactory answer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GI6-R8U7L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Taofwter","source_asin":"B0BGHC6LGS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1025363","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGHC6LGS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGHC6LGS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
