window.products.push({"id":1025491,"name":"Olive Oil Sprayer for Cooking, Food-Grade Oil Spray Glass Bottle, Reusable Oil Vinegar Dispenser for Kitchen, BBQ, Grilling, Making Salad, Baking, Fry","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wmx8vHkhL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"PACKAGING UPGRADE-- Are you looking for the safe cooking oil sprayer for protecting your health and your family? Our oil sprayer without BPA will help you prepare healthy food with low calories, is easy to control with just push a few times button. You can conveniently dispense the moderate amount of edible oil on your pans, grilles, meat, fish and salad etc, save and make the most of your oil. Is reusable and multipurpose perfect kitchenware tools for home & kitchen. Specifications: Item name: Oil Sprayer Material: Stainless Steel, Glass, Plastic Color: Stainless Steel Sliver + Transparent Glass Packaging size(W*H): 18.5 cm * 4.6 cm/7.2 inch * 1.8 inch Product weight: 0.25 Kg/ 8.18 oz Volume: 100 ml/ 3.4 oz Packaged Include: 1*Oil Sprayer; 1*Brush; 1*Funnel Easy to clean: 1. Turn counterclockwise to open, add some warm water and detergent 2. Tighten the cover clockwise 3. Shake it for 6-10 times and spray the water 4. Refill clean water spray it for 3-5 times, then wait for the oil sprayer to dry completely. Warm tips for oil Spray: a. We suggest you clean it before filling something and waiting for it to dry. b. If you use or don’t use it for some time, please keep it regular maintenance. As the density of the oil is different from the water, so the oil's performance may not so good as the water when it is sprayed. We suggest you can put the sprayer more higher a little when you use olive oil, then you'll get the better of mist. If you have any suggestions or question, please feel free to contact us, many thanks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wmx8vHkhL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"helachache","source_asin":"B07DJC3G2L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1025491","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DJC3G2L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DJC3G2L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
