window.products.push({"id":1025583,"name":"PUWEIKE Handheld Vacuum, 1.2LB Ultra Lightweight Hand Held Vacuum, Rechargeable with 6KPa Powerful Suction Car Vacuum Cleaner for Home and Car","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ypAG5qJQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"POWERFUL SUCTION BUT LESS NOISE: Portable, the turbine motor provides a stable 6000PA strong cyclonic suction for the dustbuster to absorb garbage like pet hairs, crumbs, food debris, dog hair, cat hair, cigarette ashes, paper scraps and other small things at home or car. With the noise-reducing technology produce noise lower than 75db. 1.2 POUNDS SUPER LIGHTWEIGHT & PORTABLE MINI SIZE & CORDLESS: Small vacuum cleaner and lightweight vacuum cleaner, just only 1.2 pounds, which can be hold in hand and use with ease. It‘s perfect for cleaning dust in corner, cupboard, drawer and small gaps in cars. The color and shape design is eye-pleasing no matter keep it on desk or in cars. HEPA FILTER WITH TRIPLE FILTRATION SYSTEM&DURABLE: hand vacuum featured 3-stage filtration, which has great filtering & dust-cleaning effect, and car vacuum cleaner can obstruct very small granule and dust stage by stage. Detach collection container for emptying and cleaning. The HEPA filter can be detached easily and easy to be cleaned with water, which is more durable than the ordinary filter. ALL-ROUND CLEANING, NO DEAD ANGLES: With 3 different types of attachments, The dust buster hand vacuum can help you thoroughly clean the dust of sofa, wall, stairs and other hard-to-reach areas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ypAG5qJQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PUWEIKE","source_asin":"B089VRVHTR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1025583","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089VRVHTR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089VRVHTR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
