window.products.push({"id":1025585,"name":"Pour Over Coffee Maker Serving Set with Reusable Stainless Steel Filter, 3 Cup Serving Coffee Glass, Heat Resistant, 14 fl oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eYDM5dZuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXPERIENCE PERFECTION EVERY TIME: Coffee aficionados agree; pour over brewing delivers the best cup of coffee. With Cozy Blue laser-cut, stainless steel micro mesh funnel strainer, you can unlock the full potential with every brew. Paper filters are history. They strip flavor, make waste, and damage the environment. Our pour over coffee brewer ensures flavor ends up on your lips - not in the trash. COMPLETE POUR OVER COFFEE DRIPPER SET: Perfect for the coffee lover that appreciates richer, bolder flavors and the unique enjoyment that comes with hand-crafting a perfect cup of joe. Our professional and simple-to-use stand-alone drip coffee cone will make you feel like a barista and impress your guests or simply enjoy every morning. This 14 oz pour over coffee dripper means maximum flavor and minimal effort THICK AND SUPERIOR QUALITY: Carefully crafted with thick and durable heat resistant non-porous Borosilicate glass which won’t absorb odors or chemical residues. Use our silicone mat at the bottom of the carafe to minimize the risk of slipping, cracking, or added moisture to any surface. SIMPLE TO USE: To brew the perfect cup of fresh, delicious and aromatic coffee, simply heat the pour over coffee filter with hot water and add your favorite coffee grounds. Then, using your Pour-Over Gooseneck Kettle, slowly pour in the hot water at the perfect temperature to regulate the flow of water with the optimal turbulence of coffee grounds for ideal coffee extraction. WORRY-FREE PURCHASE: At Cozy Blue, we stand behind our products to make sure you are happy with your purchase. If you are not 100% satisfied for any reason, please CONTACT US immediately through Amazon and we will do whatever it takes to ensure you are!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eYDM5dZuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cozy Blue","source_asin":"B08HQ8WJ42","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1025585","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HQ8WJ42","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HQ8WJ42","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
