window.products.push({"id":1025706,"name":"NEWTRY Electric Vegetable Slicer Commercial Fruit Slicer Machine Tomato Slicer 0-10mm (25/64inch) Thickness Adjustable Stainless Steel for Lemon Potat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":275.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71roFKZROfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"▷SHARP BLADE---The slicing machine's blade is engineered with excellent sharpness, allowing for swift and efficient slicing. Additionally, the blade is constructed using materials that provide strength and durability. When it comes to maintenance, the blade can be effortlessly disassembled for routine cleaning. Simply raise the buckle and remove the blade, allowing you to clean it with ease and ensure optimal performance at all times. ▷ELECTRIC&MANUAL USE---Not only is this a highly versatile commercial vegetable slicer, but it can also be used as both an electric and manual model, depending on your specific needs. To switch to the manual mode, simply remove the machine's shell and install the handle - it's that simple. Additionally, the slicer features a protective rubber ring designed to keep fingers safe during use, preventing any unwanted cuts or injuries. ▷0-25/64 inch ADJUSTABLE---This versatile vegetable slicer allows for easy and precise thickness control, offering slice options ranging from 0 to 10mm. Simply turn the knob located in the center of the machine to adjust the thickness to match your desired setting. With such flexibility, you can easily slice everything from delicate produce like tomatoes and cucumbers to denser items like potatoes and carrots. The user-friendly design makes operation convenient and hassle-free, perfect for both novice and experienced users alike. ▷LARGE CALIBER---With its generously sized food tank, this vegetable slicer can easily accommodate up to 1-8 lemons at a time, making it the perfect tool for preparing large quantities of food. However, when slicing larger items like cabbage, it's recommended that you first chop them into smaller chunks to ensure a smooth and consistent slicing process. This simple preparation step allows the slicer to be used with even bulkier produce without compromising efficiency or quality. ▷STAINLESS STEEL---The use of thin yet durable metal in its construction provides the perfect combination of strength and maneuverability, making it ideal for use in a variety of settings, from home kitchens to professional restaurants. Additionally, the machine's bearing is also constructed of high-grade stainless steel, providing unmatched anti-corrosion and rust-proof capabilities.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71roFKZROfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEWTRY","source_asin":"B0822SJF5Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1025706","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0822SJF5Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0822SJF5Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
