window.products.push({"id":1025878,"name":"Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner 100PCS Air Fryer Parchment Paper Liners Air Fryer Liners Nonstick Waterproof Oil Proof Heat Resistant Unbleached Baki","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61glhM1cLgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Unbleached Parchment Paper for Air Fryer】GonaRoby air fryer disposable paper liner is made of nature wood pulp paper, with double sides silicone coating featured as nonstick and heat resistant. Air fryer liners are unbleached ones, for healthy sake, not going through bleaching process which containing chlorine and fluorochemicals causing negative effects to human or nature. GonaRoby air fryer parchment paper liners non bleached are food grade, non toxic, no chlorine nor fluorochemicals. 【Double-Sided Silicone Coating】Two ways to get air fryer disposable liners non-stick and heat resistant, silicone-coated or quilon-coated. Our airfryer parchment liners are silicone-coated, both sides silicone coating, which silicone is drawn from nature without toxin. While quilon-coated contains heavy metals leading to some terrible problems. Silicone parchment paper is outstanding in nonstick and heat resistant performance, no grease required against sticking, holding heat as high as 480°F. 【Nonstick Air Fryer Paper】Air fryer disposable liners are nonstick, no need additional grease spreading, no food sticking and keep food intact. Parchment paper for baking is also water- and grease-resistant, no water or grease leaking out, no making air fryer dirty, no troublesome of cleaning up. Air fryer no sticking disposable liners help you out of air fryer basket washing and keep air fryer in best performance also. Air fryer parchment paper liners non-stick disposable help much in kitchen. 【Work with Multiple Cookwares】Our air fryer accessories of paper liner are versatile with many cookwares besides air fryer, microwave, oven, fry pan, roaster, steamer, all these do. Disposable air fryer liners are good helper for easy baking, frying, roasting, reheating also do for wrapping or dishes serving. A must-have for cookwares, nonstick, no need to grease spreading, heat resistant high enough to meet baking requirements, water- and grease-resistant, no leakage keep cookwares clean. 【Make out Less Oil Diet】Air fryer uses up to 85% less oil than traditional deep frying while maintaining the same delicious taste. With our parchment paper liners used in air fryer, this could be even more less oil, since our paper liners are nonstick no grease spreading against sticking, greaseproof and waterproof bowl-shaped liners holding vapour and heat well, so less oil required, even no oil just meat slides off, cook your food evenly without the hassles of using hot oil or thermometer. 【High Heat Resistance】Parchment paper for baking performs well in heat resistance, withstanding max to 480°F(250℃), this help makes most delicious done without worries of parchment paper get burned. Parchment paper for air fryer with high temperature resistance as up to 480°F, allows you to gently remove moisture from foods or quickly cook and crisp foods with convection heat. No burnout under this degree 480°F, any recipe required under this temp is reliable to use our air fryer paper liners. 【Resealable and Neat Package】GonaRoby parchment liners for baking are well packed in a bowl packaging, resealable to keep clean and transparent easy to identify. 100PCS unbleached airfryer parchment liners are contained. Air fryer paper liners round are flexible to bend or unbend for better usages. Air fryer liners disposable are available with holes or without holes. Paper liners with holes make more crispy, liners without holes make more fragrant and sweet. Both performs well for your baking. 【Air Fryer Parchment Paper Greaseproof Waterproof Baking Paper】GonaRoby silicone air fryer accessories are oil proof and water proof, holding contents well in it, heat evenly circulation in it. No leakage happens, no grease soak through, no water anywhere. Our parchment paper is tough and durable, tear resistance, holding a whole chicken no broken. When making french fries, roast chicken, cakes, pizza, egg tart, just apply our parchment paper liners, no hassles to clean up cookwares anymore. 【Bowl-Shaped Air Fryer Parchment Paper Liners】Creative design of our parchment liners as bowl shape, which catering to air fryer basket, match well no space waste, no food sticking to basket walls, no food leakage to basket base. Unlike the parchment paper sheets, food sticking to basket walls, ours with high liner edge no sticking anymore, fully holding food in it. No precut required none stick no basket cleanup required, our bowl-shaped parchment paper liners for baskets make it all for you. 【Hassle-Free No Need Washup】Preheat air fryer before loading air fryer disposable paper liner and food ingredients. Our parchment paper comes with hassle-free and trouble-saving operation: take some minutes to preheat air fryer before coming up to temperature, then put paper liner in, load food, wait for delicious done. Remember not to do vice verse, no put paper liners in before air fryer preheating, might suck to heating tube, either not to get parchment liners on an open flames.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61glhM1cLgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GonaRoby","source_asin":"B09SZ3DPTW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1025878","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SZ3DPTW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SZ3DPTW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1025879,"name":"ZIMFANQI 2Pcs Acrylic Display Risers Stands,11.8” Perfume Organizer, Clear Riser for Funko POP,Cupcake Dessert Display Shelf ,Makeup Organizer for Org","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VLvggur8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【STURDY AND DURABLE】Size:11.8*3.2*2.9in.Our cupcake stand are made of crystal clear acrylic material, not cheap plastic. It prevents yellowing and fading.The smooth edges will not scratch your hands and surface. The display risers will not bend under weight and is extremely durable. 【CRYSTAL CLEAR AND STYLISH】The bathroom counter organizer has a 3-tier stepped design to save space. The different heights can make each tier get a better display. Transparent acrylic looks very clean and neat with a clear view of everything. Its simple and attractive design matches perfectly with any style. 【VERSATILE APPLICATION】Acrylic organizers are great for organizing and storing small items, sorting items into orderly categories, can be applied to display jewelry, and they can be put at the perfumes,cupcakes, cakes, desserts, snacks, nail polish, jewellery,watches, essential oils, cosmetics, where you can enjoy a floating visual experience of the display. 【Easy to Clean and INSTALL 】These acrylic shelves with polished smooth surface are easy to clean, only Just rinse with water and wipe with dry cloth.Keep items easy to access and find. Increase storage space and eliminate clutter.Assembly without any tools,you only need to press the flat with your hands to get a complete acrylic perfume organizer. 【2 SETS】You can get 2 sets of acrylic risers for display. Each set contains 3 acrylic panels, 6 panels in total.They are well packed and undamaged, with a long-lasting durability.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VLvggur8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZIMFANQI","source_asin":"B0BKS3P7M4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1025879","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKS3P7M4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKS3P7M4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
