window.products.push({"id":1025922,"name":"XingMart 2ft x 3ft Sheepskin Area Rugs Faux Fur Rugs for Bedroom Plush Soft Fuzzy Carpets Bedside Rug for Girls Room Home Decor, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Gj92nWPtL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Our commitment: We have a firm commitment to quality. We take great pride in our timeless designs, premium materials and expert craftsmanship. Features: Our plush Sheepskin Rug adds warmth and softness to any room.  With its natural ivory white color, this eye-catching fur rug provides a distinct accent to your existing decor.  You can also use this fur rug over lighter hardwoods, carpeting or even on your furniture to add a fluffy, silky touch.Also can be a great decoration to your chair, couch and sofa.  As a great gift to Childrens day, Fathers day, Mothers day,Christmas decor and any occasion. Even can be sent to your family and friend as a great home decor, they will be grad with this special present. About packing: Sheepskin faux rug may have been tightly packaged, so the wool may appear flattened.  Wool fibers are very resilient and will bounce back to their original appearance and wouldn’t affect the quality of the area rugs. A vigorous shake will help the rug restore the soft, fluffiness of the wool.  Any fold marks will disappear once the rug skin has been removed from the package for several days. Machine wash steps: 1. Leave the fur rug in the laundry bag. 2. Add a small amount of mild detergent. 3. Set the machine on the gentle or delicate setting. 4. Machine dehydration, do not tumble dry. 5. Shake and brush it to fluff up the faux fur when take out the carpet. 6. Choose a site that's well ventilated for air drying. Enterprise objective: Customer satisfaction is our greatest pursuit, we will provide customers a full range of fast, meticulous, precise, and thoughtful services. Any quality related issue will be promptly handled by our customer service team to make sure you are perfectly content with your purchase!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Gj92nWPtL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XingMart","source_asin":"B08PNRVJPX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1025922","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PNRVJPX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PNRVJPX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
